'When I think of the multitude of evil things I have done...' (Multitude Evil)  \r\nLenten Triodion Canon: Triodion Odes 1, 8, 9.  \r\nLenten Exapostilarion (Trinity Light Hymn, Tone I): Exapostilarion Trinity in Tone I (Trinity Exapostilarion (Tone I), sung 3x with commemorations)  \r\nLenten Aposticha: Monday 1; Monday 2; Monday 3. Glory: Monday Glory. Both now: Monday Theotokion. (Lenten Aposticha from Triodion (Week 2, monday))  \r\nDismissal Theotokion (Tone IV, Monday): Dismissal Theotokion for Monday in Tone IV.  \r\n\r\n## HOURS\r\n\r\n**At the Hours:** At the First Hour: Lenten troparion (O order my steps); At the Third Hour: Lenten troparion (O Lord, Who at the third hour); At the Sixth Hour: Lenten troparion (O Thou Who on the sixth day); At the Ninth Hour: Lenten troparion (O Thou Who at the ninth hour).  \r\nKontakia: at the First Hour � Kontakion of the Triodion; at the Third and Ninth Hours � Kontakion of the Saint; at the Sixth Hour � Kontakion of Temple.  \r\n\n"}
